                                  }
                 },
                 {
                     "id":  4,
                     "documentId":  "lypqgsglgd2ot3bg1so5lujz",
                     "title":  "Why coir supports more circular growing",
                     "slug":  "circular-growing-with-coir",
                     "summary":  "Coconut coir turns an agricultural byproduct into a useful resource for growers.",
                     "content":  [
                                     {
                                         "type":  "paragraph",
                                         "children":  [
                                                          {
                                                              "type":  "text",
                                                              "text":  "Circular growing starts with making better use of available resources. Coir is made from coconut husks, a byproduct of the food industry."
                                                          }
                                                      ]
                                     },
                                     {
                                         "type":  "heading",
                                         "level":  2,
                                         "children":  [
                                                          {
                                                              "type":  "text",
                                                              "text":  "A practical material choice"
                                                          }
                                                      ]
                                     },
                                     {
                                         "type":  "paragraph",
                                         "children":  [
                                                          {
                                                              "type":  "text",
                                                              "text":  "When processed to meet the needs of a crop, coir can provide a renewable alternative for many growing applications. Product specifications and responsible sourcing matter at every stage."
                                                          }
                                                      ]
                                     }
                                 ],
